      "id": 9988,
      "name": "Craig",
      "username": "Craig",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/craig/{size}/2150_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-03-28T11:26:27.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hey everyone. PAX East is coming up in just a couple short weeks! I know, like a couple other folks here, I'm going to be busting my hump at the &gt;G booth, setting up all sorts of amazing demos. However, given the role I will likely have, it's unlikely that I'll actually get to&nbsp;<em>play</em> much during convention hours. That just won't stand, so I'm taking matter into my own hands.</p><p>After hours gaming! Foote and I have already been talking about getting together in the evening for some fun. We'll both have our copies of GSF, and I think there's even a chance that there might be a Tactics prototype in attendance.</p><p>Anyone here who will be at the con, or even local to Boston, who wants to join us?</p><p>Full disclosure: I do have at least one or two nights that I will be occupied until 7 or so with Unpub, playtesting my own game. That takes precedence to other gaming. Sorry. But afterward!</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:40:55.569Z",
