      "raw": "<p>Hey everyone. PAX East is coming up in just a couple short weeks! I know, like a couple other folks here, I&#39;m going to be busting my hump at the &gt;G booth, setting up all sorts of amazing demos. However, given the role I will likely have, it&#39;s unlikely that I&#39;ll actually get to&nbsp;<em>play</em> much during convention hours. That just won&#39;t stand, so I&#39;m taking matter into my own hands.</p><p>After hours gaming! Foote and I have already been talking about getting together in the evening for some fun. We&#39;ll both have our copies of GSF, and I think there&#39;s even a chance that there might be a Tactics prototype in attendance.</p><p>Anyone here who will be at the con, or even local to Boston, who wants to join us?</p><p>Full disclosure: I do have at least one or two nights that I will be occupied until 7 or so with Unpub, playtesting my own game. That takes precedence to other gaming. Sorry. But afterward!</p>",
