      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Foote\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/48/1877_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Foote:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>There is a bar around me in philly that is tabletop friendly, I go in there and play games with friends regularly. Maybe there is a local watering hole with a good size table we can post up at? I have Bruins fans to heckle, so thats a way to kill two birds with one stone for me</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>OOO… gamer friendly bar in Philly.&nbsp;  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/open_mouth.png?v=12\" title=\":open_mouth:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":open_mouth:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> &nbsp; Care to divulge it's name and address?</p>",
